.Dd September 17, 2026
.Dt ARCSYNC 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm arcsync
.Nd archive a photo library to a hybrid CD/DVD ISO
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl nqv
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -dir Ar path
.Op Fl -out Ar path
.Op Fl -media Ar type
.Op Fl -burn
.Op Fl -help
.Op Fl -version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
copies photos into a dated tree, builds a static HTML gallery, and writes a
hybrid ISO via
.Xr hdiutil 1 .
This man page is a scaffold; full ICLOUD section lands with Photos support.
